# Language statistics
#
# GitHub's linguist counts committed bytes, so the three exploratory notebooks
# (~4.3 MB, dominated by embedded base64 plot output) drown out the ~234 KB of
# Python that is the actual engineering. The repo therefore reports as ~95%
# "Jupyter Notebook".
#
# The notebooks are analysis and documentation, not the shipped codebase, so
# they are marked linguist-documentation and excluded from the language bar.
# They remain fully present, versioned and browsable — this changes the stats
# only, not the contents.
#
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md
notebooks/** linguist-documentation
*.ipynb linguist-documentation
